text-text-tertiary,#6B6B66)] [text-shadow:0_0_0_#B5AFEA] decoration-solid [text-decoration-skip-ink:auto] [text-decoration-thickness:auto] [text-underline-offset:auto] [text-underline-position:from-font] text-left no-underline group-hover:text-text-primary">2 days ago</p></div></a><a class="link-box group py-1.25 block px-2 w-full hover:bg-surface-bg" href="/blog/2026-10-23-halo"><span aria-hidden="true" class="corner-box-hover-child"></span><div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5"><p class="font-sans font-[430] not-italic lg:leading-[120%] tracking-[-0.26px] [font-variant-numeric:ordinal] text-text-tertiary text-left text-[13px] group-hover:text-text-primary">We launched Halo 😇</p><p class="font-mono text-[10px] font-normal not-italic tracking-[-0.2px] [font-variant-numeric:ordinal] [color:var(--text-text-tertiary,#6B6B66)] [text-shadow:0_0_0_#B5AFEA] decoration-solid [text-decoration-skip-ink:auto] [text-decoration-thickness:auto] [text-underline-offset:auto] [text-underline-position:from-font] text-left no-underline group-hover:text-text-primary">2 weeks ago</p></div></a><a class="link-box group py-1.25 block px-2 w-full hover:bg-surface-bg" href="/blog/2026-10-22-operating-langfuse-as-an-internal-service"><span aria-hidden="true" class="corner-box-hover-child"></span><div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5"><p class="font-sans font-[430] not-italic lg:leading-[120%] tracking-[-0.26px] [font-variant-numeric:ordinal] text-text-tertiary text-left text-[13px] group-hover:text-text-primary">Operating Langfuse as an internal service</p><p class="font-mono text-[10px] font-normal not-italic tracking-[-0.2px] [font-variant-numeric:ordinal] [color:var(--text-text-tertiary,#6B6B66)] [text-shadow:0_0_0_#B5AFEA] decoration-solid [text-decoration-skip-ink:auto] [text-decoration-thickness:auto] [text-underline-offset:auto] [text-underline-position:from-font] text-left no-underline group-hover:text-text-primary">2 weeks ago</p></div></a></div></div></div><span class="flex px-px w-full bg-line-structure h-[3px]"><span class="w-full h-full rounded-t-sm bg-surface-1"></span></span></nav></aside><main class="flex-1 min-w-0 rounded-sm pattern-bg" id="home-main-area"><div class="relative z-1"><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[680px] px-4 py-6 md:px-0"><div class="prose flex-1"><div class="mx-auto w-full"><div class="mb-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2 items-center sm:absolute sm:max-w-[15rem] sm:justify-end right-0 top-[-62px]"></div><div class="mt-4 md:mt-10 flex flex-col gap-2 md:gap-4"><a class="no-underline hover:no-underline mb-2" href="/changelog#2026-08-17-langfuse-v4">← Back to changelog</a><div><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-lg text-primary/60 mb-2 md:mb-3">August 17, 2026</div><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 md:gap-6 md:flex-row justify-between md:items-center"><div><h1 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl text-pretty font-medium">Langfuse v4 is live: faster at scale, with more ways to search, monitor, and evaluate</h1></div><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-10 gap-y-6 justify-center py-4 max-w-xl md:justify-start"><div class="flex items-center gap-4 cursor-default" data-state="closed"><img alt="Picture Max Deichmann" loading="lazy" width="40" height="40" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="rounded-full" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fpeople%2Fmaxdeichmann.jpg&amp;w=48&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_Bf4bpts7A4JXBj8RFJAW5h4dyzZm 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fpeople%2Fmaxdeichmann.jpg&amp;w=96&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_Bf4bpts7A4JXBj8RFJAW5h4dyzZm 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fpeople%2Fmaxdeichmann.jpg&amp;w=96&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_Bf4bpts7A4JXBj8RFJAW5h4dyzZm"/><span class="text-primary/60 group-hover:text-primary whitespace-nowrap">Max Deichmann</span></div></div></div></div><img alt="Langfuse v4 is live: faster at scale, with more ways to search, monitor, and evaluate" loading="lazy" width="1200" height="630" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="rounded border" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fchangelog%2F2026-08-17-langfuse-v4%2Flangfuse-v4-bento.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_Bf4bpts7A4JXBj8RFJAW5h4dyzZm 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fchangelog%2F2026-08-17-langfuse-v4%2Flangfuse-v4-bento.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_Bf4bpts7A4JXBj8RFJAW5h4dyzZm 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fchangelog%2F2026-08-17-langfuse-v4%2Flangfuse-v4-bento.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_Bf4bpts7A4JXBj8RFJAW5h4dyzZm"/><p class="text-[17px]">Query and evaluate every agent step directly, with initial table loads in milliseconds and at least 10x faster dashboards for large projects.</p></div>
<p>Langfuse v4 is live on Langfuse Cloud and generally available for <a class="transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-1 text-text-links underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2 decoration-text-links hover:text-primary hover:decoration-primary font-normal" href="/self-hosting/upgrade/upgrade-guides/upgrade-v3-to-v4">self-hosted deployments</a>. It makes it faster to debug, evaluate, and monitor complex LLM applications by letting you work with every LLM call, tool execution, and agent step directly. Initial table loads over large datasets drop from seconds to milliseconds, and dashboards over longer time ranges load at least 10x faster in large projects.</p>
<p>Langfuse Cloud becomes v4-only on <strong>November 16, 2026</strong> (<code>2026-11-16</code>)<!-- -->. Most projects need no migration. If the <strong>Migration Assistant</strong> shows actions for your project, complete them before this date.</p>
<div class="grid grid-cols-2 @container sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3"><a data-card="true" class="block @max-lg:col-span-full" href="/docs/observability/get-started"><div class="relative bg-surface-bg border border-line-structure corner-box-corners group/box corner-box-hover-stripes transition-[background] duration-180 ease-out flex h-full w-full flex-row items-center gap-2.5 text-text-primary sm:p-3 min-h-44 flex-col! items-start! gap-3! p-4"><div class="not-prose shrink-0 [&amp;_svg]:size-5 [&amp;_img]:size-5"><span class="flex size-9 items-center justify-center bg-muted-green/10 text-muted-green"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-rocket" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 15v5s3.03-.55 4-2c1.08-1.62 0-5 0-5"></path><path d="M4.5 16.5c-1.5 1.26-2 5-2 5s3.74-.5 5-2c.71-.84.7-2.13-.09-2.91a2.18 2.18 0 0 0-2.91-.09"></path><path d="M9 12a22 22 0 0 1 2-3.95A12.88 12.88 0 0 1 22 2c0 2.72-.78 7.5-6 11a22.4 22.4 0 0 1-4 2z"></path><path d="M9 12H4s.55-3.03 2-4c1.62-1.08 5 .05 5 .05"></path></svg></span></div><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col gap-1.5 [&amp;&gt;p]:text-left!"><div class="flex items-center gap-1"><h3 class="font-sans text-[14px] not-italic leading-[150%] lg:leading-[120%] tracking-[-0.26px] [font-variant-numeric:ordinal] not-prose mb-0 min-w-0 flex-1 font-medium text-left text-text-secondary">New to Langfuse</h3><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right size-4 shrink-0 text-text-secondary" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg></div><p class="font-sans text-[14px] font-[430] not-italic leading-[150%] lg:leading-[120%] tracking-[-0.26px] [font-variant-numeric:ordinal] my-0! text-left text-text-secondary">There is nothing to migrate. Start tracing with the v4 data model.</p><div class="prose-no-margin text-sm text-text-primary empty:hidden"></div></div></div></a><a href="https://cloud.langfuse.com/v4-migration" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" data-card="true" class="block @max-lg:col-span-full"><div class="relative bg-surface-bg border border-line-structure corner-box-corners group/box corner-box-hover-stripes transition-[background] duration-180 ease-out flex h-full w-full flex-row items-center gap-2.5 text-text-primary sm:p-3 min-h-44 flex-col! items-start! gap-3! p-4"><div class="not-prose shrink-0 [&amp;_svg]:size-5 [&amp;_img]:size-5"><span class="flex size-9 items-center justify-center bg-muted-blue/10 text-muted-blue"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-cloud" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M17.5 19H9a7 7 0 1 1 6.71-9h1.79a4.5 4.5 0 1 1 0 9Z"></path></svg></span></div><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col gap-1.5 [&amp;&gt;p]:text-left!"><div class="flex items-center gap-1"><h3 class="font-sans text-[14px] not-italic leading-[150%] lg:leading-[120%] tracking-[-0.26px] [font-variant-numeric:ordinal] not-prose mb-0 min-w-0 flex-1 font-medium text-left text-text-secondary">Using Langfuse Cloud</h3><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right size-4 shrink-0 text-text-secondary" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg></div><p class="font-sans text-[14px] font-[430] not-italic leading-[150%] lg:leading-[120%] tracking-[-0.26px] [font-variant-numeric:ordinal] my-0! text-left text-text-secondary">Open the Migration status page and complete only the checks detected for your project.</p><div class="prose-no-margin text-sm text-text-primary empty:hidden"></div></div></div></a><a data-card="true" class="block @max-lg:col-span-full" href="/self-hosting/upgrade/upgrade-guides/upgrade-v3-to-v4"><div class="relative bg-surface-bg border border-line-structure corner-box-corners group/box corner-box-hover-stripes transition-[background] duration-180 ease-out flex h-full w-full flex-row items-center gap-2.5 text-text-primary sm:p-3 min-h-44 flex-col! items-start! gap-3! p-4"><div class="not-prose shrink-0 [&amp;_svg]:size-5 [&amp;_img]:size-5"><span class="flex size-9 items-center justify-center bg-surface-2 text-text-secondary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-server-cog" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m10.852 14.772-.383.923"></path><path d="M13.148 14.772a3 3 0 1 0-2.296-5.544l-.383-.923"></path><path d="m13.148 9.228.383-.923"></path><path d="m13.53 15.696-.382-.924a3 3 0 1 1-2.296-5.544"></path><path d="m14.772 10.852.923-.383"></path><path d="m14.772 13.148.923.383"></path><path d="M4.5 10H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h16a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-.5"></path><path d="M4.5 14H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-4a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-.5"></path><path d="M6 18h.01"></path><path d="M6 6h.01"></path><path d="m9.228 10.852-.923-.383"></path><path d="m9.228 13.148-.923.383"></path></svg></span></div><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col gap-1.5 [&amp;&gt;p]:text-left!"><div class="flex items-center gap-1"><h3 class="font-sans text-[14px] not-italic leading-[150%] lg:leading-[120%] tracking-[-0.26px] [font-variant-numeric:ordinal] not-prose mb-0 min-w-0 flex-1 font-medium text-left text-text-secondary">Self-hosting Langfuse</h3><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right size-4 shrink-0 text-text-secondary" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg></div><p class="font-sans text-[14px] font-[430] not-italic leading-[150%] lg:leading-[120%] tracking-[-0.26px] [font-variant-numeric:ordinal] my-0! text-left text-text-secondary">Plan the upgrade on your schedule and review the infrastructure requirements first.</p><div class="prose-no-margin text-sm text-text-primary empty:hidden"></div></div></div></a></div>
<h2 id="what-we-shipped-in-langfuse-v4" class="group/heading flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-1"><a data-card="" href="#what-we-shipped-in-langfuse-v4">What we shipped in Langfuse v4</a><button aria-label="Copy Anchor Link" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md text-sm font-medium duration-100 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-fd-ring hover:bg-fd-accent hover:text-fd-accent-foreground p-1 [&amp;_svg]:size-4 not-prose shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity group-hover/heading:opacity-100"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-link" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"></path><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"></path></svg></button></h2>
<p>Langfuse v4 is much faster and also ships new ways to search, monitor, evaluate, and query your application data. Check them out:</p>
<div class="grid grid-cols-2 @container gap-3"><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-card="true" class="block @max-lg:col-span-full" href="/changelog/2026-06-19-monitors"><div class="relative bg-surface-bg border border-line-structure corner-box-corners group/box corner-box-hover-stripes transition-[background] duration-180 ease-out flex h-full w-full flex-row items-center gap-2.5 text-text-primary sm:p-3 min-h-36 flex-col! items-start! gap-3! p-4"><div class="not-prose shrink-0 [&amp;_svg]:size-5 [&amp;_img]:size-5"><span class="flex size-9 items-center justify-center bg-surface-2 text-text-secondary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-bell" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10.268 21a2 2 0 0 0 3.464 0"></path><path d="M3.262 15.326A1 1 0 0 0 4 17h16a1 1 0 0 0 .74-1.673C19.41 13.956 18 12.499 18 8A6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 4.499-1.411 5.956-2.738 7.326"></path></svg></span></div><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col gap-1.5 [&amp;&gt;p]:text-left!"><div class="flex items-center gap-1"><h3 class="font-sans text-[14px] not-italic leading-[150%] lg:leading-[120%] tracking-[-0.26px] [font-variant-numeric:ordinal] not-prose mb-0 min-w-0 flex-1 font-medium text-left text-text-secondary">Monitors</h3><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right size-4 shrink-0 text-text-secondary" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg></div><p class="font-sans text-[14px] font-[430] not-italic leading-[150%] lg:leading-[120%] tracking-[-0.26px] [font-variant-numeric:ordinal] my-0! text-left text-text-secondary">Watch cost, quality, and latency thresholds and notify teams through Slack, webhooks, or GitHub Actions.</p><div class="prose-no-margin text-sm text-text-primary empty:hidden"></div></div></div></a><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-card="true" class="block @max-lg:col-span-full" href="/changelog/2026-05-28-code-evaluators"><div class="relative bg-surface-bg border border-line-structure corner-box-corners group/box corner-box-hover-stripes transition-[background] duration-180 ease-out flex h-full w-full flex-row items-center gap-2.5 text-text-primary sm:p-3 min-h-36 flex-col! items-start! gap-3! p-4"><div class="not-prose shrink-0 [&amp;_svg]:size-5 [&amp;_img]:size-5"><span class="flex size-9 items-center justify-center bg-muted-blue/10 text-muted-blue"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-code-xml" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m18 16 4-4-4-4"></path><path d="m6 8-4 4 4 4"></path><path d="m14.5 4-5 16"></path></svg></span></div><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col gap-1.5 [&amp;&gt;p]:text-left!"><div class="flex items-center gap-1"><h3 class="font-sans text-[14px] not-italic leading-[150%] lg:leading-[120%] tracking-[-0.26px] [font-variant-numeric:ordinal] not-prose mb-0 min-w-0 flex-1 font-medium text-left text-text-secondary">Code evaluators</h3><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right size-4 shrink-0 text-text-secondary" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg></div><p class="font-sans text-[14px] font-[430] not-italic leading-[150%] lg:leading-[120%] tracking-[-0.26px] [font-variant-numeric:ordinal] my-0! text-left text-text-secondary">Run deterministic Python or TypeScript checks on live observations and experiments.</p><div class="prose-no-margin text-sm text-text-primary empty:hidden"></div></div></div></a><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-card="true" class="block @max-lg:col-span-full" href="/docs/observability/features/filter-search-bar"><div class="relative bg-surface-bg border border-line-structure corner-box-corners group/box corner-box-hover-stripes transition-[background] duration-180 ease-out flex h-full w-full flex-row items-center gap-2.5 text-text-primary sm:p-3 min-h-36 flex-col! items-start! gap-3! p-4"><div class="not-prose shrink-0 [&amp;_svg]:size-5 [&amp;_img]:size-5"><span class="flex size-9 items-center justify-center bg-muted-blue/10 text-muted-blue"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-search" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m21 21-4.34-4.34"></path><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle></svg></span></div><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col gap-1.5 [&amp;&gt;p]:text-left!"><div class="flex items-center gap-1"><h3 class="font-sans text-[14px] not-italic leading-[150%] lg:leading-[120%] tracking-[-0.26px] [font-variant-numeric:ordinal] not-prose mb-0 min-w-0 flex-1 font-medium text-left text-text-secondary">Filter search bar</h3><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right size-4 shrink-0 text-text-secondary" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg></div><p class="font-sans text-[14px] font-[430] not-italic leading-[150%] lg:leading-[120%] tracking-[-0.26px] [font-variant-numeric:ordinal] my-0! text-left text-text-secondary">Combine typed filters, metadata, and scores in one shareable query.</p><div class="prose-no-margin text-sm text-text-primary empty:hidden"></div></div></div></a><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-card="true" class="block @max-lg:col-span-full" href="/docs/observability/features/full-text-search"><div class="relative bg-surface-bg border border-line-structure corner-box-corners group/box corner-box-hover-stripes transition-[background] duration-180 ease-out flex h-full w-full flex-row items-center gap-2.5 text-text-primary sm:p-3 min-h-36 flex-col! items-start! gap-3! p-4"><div class="not-prose shrink-0 [&amp;_svg]:size-5 [&amp;_img]:size-5"><span class="flex size-9 items-center justify-center bg-muted-green/10 text-muted-green"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-search" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m21 21-4.34-4.34"></path><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle></svg></span></div><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col gap-1.5 [&amp;&gt;p]:text-left!"><div class="flex items-center gap-1"><h3 class="font-sans text-[14px] not-italic leading-[150%] lg:leading-[120%] tracking-[-0.26px] [font-variant-numeric:ordinal] not-prose mb-0 min-w-0 flex-1 font-medium text-left text-text-secondary">Full-text search</h3><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right size-4 shrink-0 text-text-secondary" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg></div><p class="font-sans text-[14px] font-[430] not-italic leading-[150%] lg:leading-[120%] tracking-[-0.26px] [font-variant-numeric:ordinal] my-0! text-left text-text-secondary">Find words and phrases across observation inputs, outputs, and metadata.</p><div class="prose-no-margin text-sm text-text-primary empty:hidden"></div></div></div></a><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-card="true" class="block @max-lg:col-span-full" href="/changelog/2026-07-28-langfuse-pulse"><div class="relative bg-surface-bg border border-line-structure corner-box-corners group/box corner-box-hover-stripes transition-[background] duration-180 ease-out flex h-full w-full flex-row items-center gap-2.5 text-text-primary sm:p-3 min-h-36 flex-col! items-start! gap-3! p-4"><div class="not-prose shrink-0 [&amp;_svg]:size-5 [&amp;_img]:size-5"><span class="flex size-9 items-center justify-center bg-muted-green/10 text-muted-green"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chart-line" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 3v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16"></path><path d="m19 9-5 5-4-4-3 3"></path></svg></span></div><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col gap-1.5 [&amp;&gt;p]:text-left!"><div class="flex items-center gap-1"><h3 class="font-sans text-[14px] not-italic leading-[150%] lg:leading-[120%] tracking-[-0.26px] [font-variant-numeric:ordinal] not-prose mb-0 min-w-0 flex-1 font-medium text-left text-text-secondary">Pulse</h3><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right size-4 shrink-0 text-text-secondary" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg></div><p class="font-sans text-[14px] font-[430] not-italic leading-[150%] lg:leading-[120%] tracking-[-0.26px] [font-variant-numeric:ordinal] my-0! text-left text-text-secondary">Plot count, cost, or latency above the Observations table and select a spike to inspect its operations.</p><div class="prose-no-margin text-sm text-text-primary empty:hidden"></div></div></div></a><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-card="true" class="block @max-lg:col-span-full" href="/docs/api-and-data-platform/features/halo"><div class="relative bg-surface-bg border border-line-structure corner-box-corners group/box corner-box-hover-stripes transition-[background] duration-180 ease-out flex h-full w-full flex-row items-center gap-2.5 text-text-primary sm:p-3 min-h-36 flex-col! items-start! gap-3! p-4"><div class="not-prose shrink-0 [&amp;_svg]:size-5 [&amp;_img]:size-5"><span class="flex size-9 items-center justify-center bg-muted-green/10 text-muted-green"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-bot" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 8V4H8"></path><rect width="16" height="12" x="4" y="8" rx="2"></rect><path d="M2 14h2"></path><path d="M20 14h2"></path><path d="M15 13v2"></path><path d="M9 13v2"></path></svg></span></div><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col gap-1.5 [&amp;&gt;p]:text-left!"><div class="flex items-center gap-1"><h3 class="font-sans text-[14px] not-italic leading-[150%] lg:leading-[120%] tracking-[-0.26px] [font-variant-numeric:ordinal] not-prose mb-0 min-w-0 flex-1 font-medium text-left text-text-secondary">Halo</h3><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right size-4 shrink-0 text-text-secondary" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg></div><p class="font-sans text-[14px] font-[430] not-italic leading-[150%] lg:leading-[120%] tracking-[-0.26px] [font-variant-numeric:ordinal] my-0! text-left text-text-secondary">Ask questions about traces, observations, sessions, and metrics in plain language.</p><div class="prose-no-margin text-sm text-text-primary empty:hidden"></div></div></div></a><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-card="true" class="block @max-lg:col-span-full" href="/docs/api-and-data-platform/features/public-api#v2"><div class="relative bg-surface-bg border border-line-structure corner-box-corners group/box corner-box-hover-stripes transition-[background] duration-180 ease-out flex h-full w-full flex-row items-center gap-2.5 text-text-primary sm:p-3 min-h-36 flex-col! items-start! gap-3! p-4"><div class="not-prose shrink-0 [&amp;_svg]:size-5 [&amp;_img]:size-5"><span class="flex size-9 items-center justify-center bg-surface-2 text-text-secondary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-database" aria-hidden="true"><ellipse cx="12" cy="5" rx="9" ry="3"></ellipse><path d="M3 5V19A9 3 0 0 0 21 19V5"></path><path d="M3 12A9 3 0 0 0 21 12"></path></svg></span></div><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col gap-1.5 [&amp;&gt;p]:text-left!"><div class="flex items-center gap-1"><h3 class="font-sans text-[14px] not-italic leading-[150%] lg:leading-[120%] tracking-[-0.26px] [font-variant-numeric:ordinal] not-prose mb-0 min-w-0 flex-1 font-medium text-left text-text-secondary">Observations API v2</h3><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right size-4 shrink-0 text-text-secondary" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg></div><p class="font-sans text-[14px] font-[430] not-italic leading-[150%] lg:leading-[120%] tracking-[-0.26px] [font-variant-numeric:ordinal] my-0! text-left text-text-secondary">Retrieve selected observation fields with cursor-based pagination.</p><div class="prose-no-margin text-sm text-text-primary empty:hidden"></div></div></div></a><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-card="true" class="block @max-lg:col-span-full" href="/docs/metrics/features/metrics-api#v2"><div class="relative bg-surface-bg border border-line-structure corner-box-corners group/box corner-box-hover-stripes transition-[background] duration-180 ease-out flex h-full w-full flex-row items-center gap-2.5 text-text-primary sm:p-3 min-h-36 flex-col! items-start! gap-3! p-4"><div class="not-prose shrink-0 [&amp;_svg]:size-5 [&amp;_img]:size-5"><span class="flex size-9 items-center justify-center bg-muted-blue/10 text-muted-blue"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chart-line" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 3v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16"></path><path d="m19 9-5 5-4-4-3 3"></path></svg></span></div><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col gap-1.5 [&amp;&gt;p]:text-left!"><div class="flex items-center gap-1"><h3 class="font-sans text-[14px] not-italic leading-[150%] lg:leading-[120%] tracking-[-0.26px] [font-variant-numeric:ordinal] not-prose mb-0 min-w-0 flex-1 font-medium text-left text-text-secondary">Metrics API v2</h3><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right size-4 shrink-0 text-text-secondary" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg></div><p class="font-sans text-[14px] font-[430] not-italic leading-[150%] lg:leading-[120%] tracking-[-0.26px] [font-variant-numeric:ordinal] my-0! text-left text-text-secondary">Aggregate cost, tokens, volume, latency, and scores across observations.</p><div class="prose-no-margin text-sm text-text-primary empty:hidden"></div></div></div></a></div>
<h2 id="upgrade-langfuse-cloud-projects" class="group/heading flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-1"><a data-card="" href="#upgrade-langfuse-cloud-projects">Upgrade Langfuse Cloud projects</a><button aria-label="Copy Anchor Link" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md text-sm font-medium duration-100 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-fd-ring hover:bg-fd-accent hover:text-fd-accent-foreground p-1 [&amp;_svg]:size-4 not-prose shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity group-hover/heading:opacity-100"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-link" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"></path><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"></path></svg></button></h2>
<p>Langfuse Cloud deprecates v3 endpoints and features on <strong>November 16, 2026</strong> (<code>2026-11-16</code>)<!-- -->. Please complete any migration requirements for your projects before this date.</p>
<div class="my-6 overflow-x-auto"><div class="min-w-[640px] pr-8"><div class="relative ml-36 mb-1 h-5 text-xs text-muted-foreground"><span class="absolute -translate-x-1/2" style="left:0%">Jan<!-- --> <!-- -->2026</span><span class="absolute -translate-x-1/2" style="left:20%">Apr<!-- --> <!-- -->2026</span><span class="absolute -translate-x-1/2" style="left:40%">Jul<!-- --> <!-- -->2026</span><span class="absolute -translate-x-1/2" style="left:60%">Oct<!-- --> <!-- -->2026</span><span class="absolute -translate-x-1/2" style="left:80%">Jan<!-- --> <!-- -->2027</span><span class="absolute -translate-x-1/2" style="left:100%">Apr<!-- --> <!-- -->2027</span></div><div class="relative"><div class="absolute inset-y-0 left-36 right-0"><span class="absolute inset-y-0 border-l border-line-structure" style="left:0%"></span><span class="absolute inset-y-0 border-l border-line-structure" style="left:20%"></span><span class="absolute inset-y-0 border-l border-line-structure" style="left:40%"></span><span class="absolute inset-y-0 border-l border-line-structure" style="left:60%"></span><span class="absolute inset-y-0 border-l border-line-structure" style="left:80%"></span><span class="absolute inset-y-0 border-l border-line-structure" style="left:100%"></span></div><div class="absolute inset-y-0 left-36 right-0 pointer-events-none"><span class="absolute inset-y-0 z-10 border-l-2 border-dashed border-amber-600 dark:border-amber-400" style="left:66.66666666666666%"></span></div><div class="relative flex items-center gap-0 py-1.5"><div class="w-36 shrink-0 pr-3 text-right text-sm font-medium">Langfuse Cloud</div><div class="relative h-10 flex-1"><a title="Langfuse Cloud ran v3 until March 2026" class="absolute inset-y-0 flex items-center overflow-hidden rounded px-3 text-sm font-medium no-underline hover:opacity-80 bg-muted text-muted-foreground" style="left:calc(0% + 1px);width:calc(13.333333333333334% - 2px)" href="/docs/compatibility#sdk-server"><span class="truncate">v3</span></a><a title="Since March 10, 2026: Langfuse v3 with all v4 features available in the Langfuse v4 preview" class="absolute inset-y-0 flex items-center overflow-hidden rounded px-3 text-sm font-medium no-underline hover:opacity-80 bg-muted-blue text-foreground" style="left:calc(13.333333333333334% + 1px);width:calc(53.33333333333332% - 2px)" href="/changelog/2026-08-17-langfuse-v4"><span class="truncate">v3 + v4 preview</span></a><a title="On November 16, 2026, Langfuse Cloud switches to v4 as the only experience and legacy APIs, features, and ingestion are removed" class="absolute inset-y-0 flex items-center overflow-hidden rounded px-3 text-sm font-medium no-underline hover:opacity-80 bg-muted-green text-foreground" style="left:calc(66.66666666666666% + 1px);width:calc(33.33333333333334% - 2px)" href="/changelog/2026-08-17-langfuse-v4"><span class="truncate">v4</span></a></div></div></div><div class="relative ml-36 mt-1.5 h-5 text-xs"><span class="absolute -translate-x-1/2 whitespace-nowrap font-medium text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400" style="left:66.66666666666666%">Nov 16, 2026: Legacy APIs, features, and ingestion removed</span></div></div></div>
<p>New projects already use v4 and need no migration.</p>
<p>For existing projects, organization owners can open the <strong>Migration Assistant</strong> sidebar and the <a href="https://cloud.langfuse.com/v4-migration" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-1 text-text-links underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2 decoration-text-links hover:text-primary hover:decoration-primary font-normal"><strong>Migration status page</strong></a> to see if any actions are required:</p>
<div class="mt-4 border rounded inline-block overflow-hidden"><div class="block bg-primary/5 [&amp;&gt;*]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*]:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;*]:p-0 [&amp;_img]:block [&amp;_img]:w-full [&amp;_img]:h-auto [&amp;_img]:leading-none [&amp;_img]:align-top [&amp;_img]:my-0 [&amp;_p]:my-0 max-w-full"><p><img alt="The Langfuse v4 migration assistant lists the exact SDK, evaluator, API, and integration actions detected for a Cloud project" loading="lazy" width="0" height="0" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent;width:100%;height:auto" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 800px" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fchangelog%2F2026-08-17-langfuse-v4%2Fv4-migration-assistant.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_Bf4bpts7A4JXBj8RFJAW5h4dyzZm 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fchangelog%2F2026-08-17-langfuse-v4%2Fv4-migration-assistant.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_Bf4bpts7A4JXBj8RFJAW5h4dyzZm 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fchangelog%2F2026-08-17-langfuse-v4%2Fv4-migration-assistant.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_Bf4bpts7A4JXBj8RFJAW5h4dyzZm 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fchangelog%2F2026-08-17-langfuse-v4%2Fv4-migration-assistant.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_Bf4bpts7A4JXBj8RFJAW5h4dyzZm 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fchangelog%2F2026-08-17-langfuse-v4%2Fv4-migration-assistant.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_Bf4bpts7A4JXBj8RFJAW5h4dyzZm 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fchangelog%2F2026-08-17-langfuse-v4%2Fv4-migration-assistant.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_Bf4bpts7A4JXBj8RFJAW5h4dyzZm 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fchangelog%2F2026-08-17-langfuse-v4%2Fv4-migration-assistant.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_Bf4bpts7A4JXBj8RFJAW5h4dyzZm 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fchangelog%2F2026-08-17-langfuse-v4%2Fv4-migration-assistant.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_Bf4bpts7A4JXBj8RFJAW5h4dyzZm 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fchangelog%2F2026-08-17-langfuse-v4%2Fv4-migration-assistant.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_Bf4bpts7A4JXBj8RFJAW5h4dyzZm"/></p></div></div>
<p>We will email project owners and admins a summary of the actions required for their projects. Complete those actions by <strong>November 16, 2026</strong> (<code>2026-11-16</code>)<!-- -->.</p>
<p>Follow the <a class="transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-1 text-text-links underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2 decoration-text-links hover:text-primary hover:decoration-primary font-normal" href="/faq/all/upgrade-to-langfuse-v4">upgrade guide</a> for more details.</p>
<h2 id="upgrade-self-hosted-langfuse-instance" class="group/heading flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-1"><a data-card="" href="#upgrade-self-hosted-langfuse-instance">Upgrade self-hosted Langfuse instance</a><button aria-label="Copy Anchor Link" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md text-sm font-medium duration-100 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-fd-ring hover:bg-fd-accent hover:text-fd-accent-foreground p-1 [&amp;_svg]:size-4 not-prose shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity group-hover/heading:opacity-100"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-link" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"></path><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"></path></svg></button></h2>
<p>Langfuse v4 is generally available for self-hosted deployments. There is no forced cutover date, and Langfuse v3 will receive security patches through January 2027.</p>
<p>Follow the <a class="transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-1 text-text-links underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2 decoration-text-links hover:text-primary hover:decoration-primary font-normal" href="/self-hosting/upgrade/upgrade-guides/upgrade-v3-to-v4">self-hosted v3 to v4 migration guide</a> to review the infrastructure requirements and plan your upgrade.</p>
<h2 id="technical-background-v4-does-less-work-for-the-same-query" class="group/heading flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-1"><a data-card="" href="#technical-background-v4-does-less-work-for-the-same-query">Technical background: V4 does less work for the same query</a><button aria-label="Copy Anchor Link" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md text-sm font-medium duration-100 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-fd-ring hover:bg-fd-accent hover:text-fd-accent-foreground p-1 [&amp;_svg]:size-4 not-prose shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity group-hover/heading:opacity-100"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-link" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"></path><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"></path></svg></button></h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>Queries scan less data.</strong> One denormalized observations table replaces read-time joins between traces and observations.</li>
<li><strong>Ingestion writes less data.</strong> Each completed observation is written once.</li>
<li><strong>Immutable data creates room to optimize.</strong> Append-only observations give us the architectural freedom to introduce optimizations such as materialized views in the future.</li>
</ul>
<div class="mt-4 border rounded inline-block overflow-hidden"><div class="block bg-primary/5 [&amp;&gt;*]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*]:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;*]:p-0 [&amp;_img]:block [&amp;_img]:w-full [&amp;_img]:h-auto [&amp;_img]:leading-none [&amp;_img]:align-top [&amp;_img]:my-0 [&amp;_p]:my-0 max-w-full"><p><img alt="Langfuse v3 joins and deduplicates mutable traces and observations at query time, while v4 aggregates immutable observations in one pass to produce the same cost-by-user result" loading="lazy" width="0" height="0" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent;width:100%;height:auto" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 800px" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fchangelog%2F2026-08-17-langfuse-v4%2Fv4-data-model-explainer.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_Bf4bpts7A4JXBj8RFJAW5h4dyzZm 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fchangelog%2F2026-08-17-langfuse-v4%2Fv4-data-model-explainer.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_Bf4bpts7A4JXBj8RFJAW5h4dyzZm 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fchangelog%2F2026-08-17-langfuse-v4%2Fv4-data-model-explainer.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_Bf4bpts7A4JXBj8RFJAW5h4dyzZm 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fchangelog%2F2026-08-17-langfuse-v4%2Fv4-data-model-explainer.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_Bf4bpts7A4JXBj8RFJAW5h4dyzZm 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fchangelog%2F2026-08-17-langfuse-v4%2Fv4-data-model-explainer.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_Bf4bpts7A4JXBj8RFJAW5h4dyzZm 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fchangelog%2F2026-08-17-langfuse-v4%2Fv4-data-model-explainer.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_Bf4bpts7A4JXBj8RFJAW5h4dyzZm 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fchangelog%2F2026-08-17-langfuse-v4%2Fv4-data-model-explainer.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_Bf4bpts7A4JXBj8RFJAW5h4dyzZm 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fchangelog%2F2026-08-17-langfuse-v4%2Fv4-data-model-explainer.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_Bf4bpts7A4JXBj8RFJAW5h4dyzZm 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fchangelog%2F2026-08-17-langfuse-v4%2Fv4-data-model-explainer.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_Bf4bpts7A4JXBj8RFJAW5h4dyzZm"/></p></div></div>
<p>Older SDKs sent updates to both traces and observations, which we stored in separate tables. Before ClickHouse could return a result, it had to join those tables and deduplicate the updates. This was slow at scale.</p>
<p>The Langfuse Python SDK 4.7.0 or later and JS/TS SDK 5.4.0 or later add trace-level attributes such as <code>user_id</code> and <code>session_id</code> to every observation before it is ingested into Langfuse. Each observation is written to a new immutable, append-only table. The same query now needs neither a join nor deduplication, which makes it much faster.</p>
<h2 id="questions" class="group/heading flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-1"><a data-card="" href="#questions">Questions</a><button aria-label="Copy Anchor Link" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md text-sm font-medium duration-100 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-fd-ring hover:bg-fd-accent hover:text-fd-accent-foreground p-1 [&amp;_svg]:size-4 not-prose shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity group-hover/heading:opacity-100"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-link" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"></path><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"></path></svg></button></h2>
<p>Ask rollout and migration questions via the in-app support form or on the <a href="https://github.com/orgs/langfuse/discussions/12518" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-1 text-text-links underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2 decoration-text-links hover:text-primary hover:decoration-primary font-normal">v4 GitHub Discussion post</a>.</p>
<p>You can also join a live Q&amp;A with the Langfuse engineering team. Bring migration questions or your actual setup:</p>
