s hover:text-primary hover:decoration-primary font-normal\",\"children\":\"self-hosted deployments\"}],\". It makes it faster to debug, evaluate, and monitor complex LLM applications by letting you work with every LLM call, tool execution, and agent step directly. Initial table loads over large datasets drop from seconds to milliseconds, and dashboards over longer time ranges load at least 10x faster in large projects.\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"Langfuse Cloud becomes v4-only on \",[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"November 16, 2026\"}],\" (\",[\"$\",\"code\",null,{\"children\":\"2026-11-16\"}],\")\"],\". Most projects need no migration. If the \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Migration Assistant\"}],\" shows actions for your project, complete them before this date.\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"grid grid-cols-2 @container sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L81\",null,{\"href\":\"/docs/observability/get-started\",\"data-card\":true,\"className\":\"block @max-lg:col-span-full\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"className\":\"relative bg-surface-bg border border-line-structure corner-box-corners group/box corner-box-hover-stripes transition-[background] duration-180 ease-out flex h-full w-full flex-row items-center gap-2.5 text-text-primary sm:p-3 min-h-44 flex-col! items-start! gap-3! p-4\",\"style\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"not-prose shrink-0 [\u0026_svg]:size-5 [\u0026_img]:size-5\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"flex size-9 items-center justify-center bg-muted-green/10 text-muted-green\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":24,\"height\":24,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-rocket\",\"aria-hidden\"