:opacity-80 bg-muted text-muted-foreground\",\"style\":{\"left\":\"calc(0% + 1px)\",\"width\":\"calc(13.333333333333334% - 2px)\"},\"children\":[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"truncate\",\"children\":\"v3\"}]}],[\"$\",\"$L4b\",\"v3 + v4 preview\",{\"href\":\"/changelog/2026-08-17-langfuse-v4\",\"title\":\"Since March 10, 2026: Langfuse v3 with all v4 features available in the Langfuse v4 preview\",\"className\":\"absolute inset-y-0 flex items-center overflow-hidden rounded px-3 text-sm font-medium no-underline hover:opacity-80 bg-muted-blue text-foreground\",\"style\":{\"left\":\"calc(13.333333333333334% + 1px)\",\"width\":\"calc(53.33333333333332% - 2px)\"},\"children\":[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"truncate\",\"children\":\"v3 + v4 preview\"}]}],[\"$\",\"$L4b\",\"v4\",{\"href\":\"/changelog/2026-08-17-langfuse-v4\",\"title\":\"On November 16, 2026, Langfuse Cloud switches to v4 as the only experience and legacy APIs, features, and ingestion are removed\",\"className\":\"absolute inset-y-0 flex items-center overflow-hidden rounded px-3 text-sm font-medium no-underline hover:opacity-80 bg-muted-green text-foreground\",\"style\":{\"left\":\"calc(66.66666666666666% + 1px)\",\"width\":\"calc(33.33333333333334% - 2px)\"},\"children\":[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"truncate\",\"children\":\"v4\"}]}]]}]]}]]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"relative ml-36 mt-1.5 h-5 text-xs\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",\"Nov 16, 2026: Legacy APIs, features, and ingestion removed\",{\"className\":\"absolute -translate-x-1/2 whitespace-nowrap font-medium text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400\",\"style\":{\"left\":\"66.66666666666666%\"},\"children\":\"Nov 16, 2026: Legacy APIs, features, and ingestion removed\"}]]}]]}]}]\n8b:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"New projects already use v4 and need no migration.\"}]\n8c:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"For existing projects, organization owners can open the \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Migration Assistant\"}],\" sidebar and the \",[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://cloud.langfuse.com/v4-migration\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"className\":\"transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-1 text-text-links underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2 decoration-text-links hover:text-primary hover:decoration-primary font-normal\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Migration status page\"}]}],\" to see if any actions are required:\"]}]\n8d:[\"$\",\"$Lab\",null,{\"fullWidth\":true,\"children\":[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$Lac\",null,{\"src\":\"/images/changelog/2026-08-17-langfuse-v4/v4-migration-assistant.png\",\"alt\":\"The Langfuse v4 migration assistant lists the exact SDK, evaluator, API, and integration actions detected for a Cloud project\",\"width\":0,\"height\":0,\"sizes\":\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 800px\",\"quality\":\"$undefined\",\"style\":{\"width\":\"100%\",\"height\":\"auto\"},\"priority\":\"$undefined\",\"className\":\"$undefined\"}]}]}]\n8e:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"We will email project owners and admins a summary of the actions required for their projects. Complete those actions by \",[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"November 16, 2026\"}],\" (\",[\"$\",\"code\",null,{\"children\":\"2026-11-16\"}],\")\"],\".\"]}]\n8f:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"Follow the \",[\"$\",\"$L4b\",null,{\"href\":\"/faq/all/upgrade-to-langfuse-v4\",\"target\":\"$undefined\",\"rel\":\"$undefined\",\"className\":\"transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-1 text-text-links underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2 decoration-text-links hover:text-primary hover:decoration-primary font-normal\",\"children\":\"upgrade guide\"}],\" for more details.\"]}]\n90:[\"$\",\"$La1\",null,{\"as\":\"h2\",\"id\":\"upgrade-self-hosted-langfuse-instance\",\"children\":\"Upgrade self-hosted Langfuse instance\"}]\n91:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Langfuse v4 is generally available for self-hosted deployments. There is no forced cutover date, and Langfuse v3 will receive security patches through January 2027.\"}]\n92:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"Follow the \",[\"$\",\"$L4b\",null,{\"href\":\"/self-hosting/upgrade/upgrade-guides/upgrade-v3-to-v4\",\"target\":\"$undefined\",\"rel\":\"$undefined\",\"className\":\"transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-1 text-text-links underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2 decoration-text-links hover:text-primary hover:decoration-primary font-normal\",\"children\":\"self-hosted v3 to v4 migration guide\"}],\" to review the infrastructure requirements and plan your upgrade.\"]}]\n93:[\"$\",\"$La1\",null,{\"as\":\"h2\",\"id\":\"technical-background-v4-does-less-work-for-the-same-query\",\"children\":\"Technical background: V4 does less work for the same query\"}]\n94:[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Queries scan less data.\"}],\" One denormalized observations table replaces read-time joins between traces and observations.\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Ingestion writes less data.\"}],\" Each completed observation is written once.\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Immutable data creates room to optimize.\"}],\" Append-only observations give us the architectural freedom to introduce optimizations such as materialized views in the future.\"]}],\"\\n\"]}]\n95:[\"$\",\"$Lab\",null,{\"fullWidth\":true,\"children\":[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$Lac\",null,{\"src\":\"/images/changelog/2026-08-17-langfuse-v4/v4-data-model-explainer.png\",\"alt\":\"Langfuse v3 joins and deduplicates mutable traces and observations at query time, while v4 aggregates immutable observations in one pass to produce the same cost-by-user result\",\"width\":0,\"height\":0,\"sizes\":\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 800px\",\"quality\":\"$undefined\",\"style\":{\"width\":\"100%\",\"height\":\"auto\"},\"priority\":\"$undefined\",\"className\":\"$undefined\"}]}]}]\n96:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Older SDKs sent updates to both traces and observations, which we stored in separate tables. Before ClickHouse could return a result, it had to join those tables and deduplicate the updates. This was slow at scale.\"}]\n97:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"The Langfuse Python SDK 4.7.0 or later and JS/TS SDK 5.4.0 or later add trace-level attributes such as \",[\"$\",\"code\",null,{\"children\":\"user_id\"}],\" and \",[\"$\",\"code\",null,{\"children\":\"session_id\"}],\" to every observation before it is ingested into Langfuse. Each observation is written to a new immutable, append-only table. The same query now needs neither a join nor deduplication, which makes it much faster.\"]}]\n98:[\"$\",\"$La1\",null,{\"as\":\"h2\",\"id\":\"questions\",\"children\":\"Questions\"}]\n99:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"Ask rollout and migration questions via the in-app support form or on the \",[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://github.com/orgs/langfuse/discussions/12518\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"className\":\"transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-1 text-text-links underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2 decoration-text-links hover:text-primary hover:decoration-primary font-normal\",\"children\":\"v4 GitHub Discussion post\"}],\".\"]}]\n9a:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"You can also join a live Q\u0026A with the Langfuse engineering team. Bring migration questions or your actual setup:\"}]\n9b:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"className\":\"relative bg-surface-bg border border-line-structure corner-box-corner